    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom versus Foolishness"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom has built her house;",
          "she has carved out her seven pillars."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She has prepared her meat; she has mixed her wine;",
          "she has also set her table."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She has sent out her female servants;",
          "she calls out from the highest points of the city:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Whoever is inexperienced, enter here! ”",
          "To the one who lacks sense, she says,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Come, eat my bread,",
          "and drink the wine I have mixed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Leave inexperience behind, and you will live;",
          "pursue the way of understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who corrects a mocker",
          "will bring abuse on himself;",
          "the one who rebukes the wicked will get hurt."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t rebuke a mocker, or he will hate you;",
          "rebuke the wise, and he will love you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Instruct the wise, and he will be wiser still;",
          "teach the righteous, and he will learn more."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom,",
          "and the knowledge of the Holy One is understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For by me your days will be many,",
          "and years will be added to your life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If you are wise, you are wise for your own benefit;",
          "if you mock, you alone will bear the consequences.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Folly is a rowdy woman;",
          "she is gullible and knows nothing."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She sits by the doorway of her house,",
          "on a seat at the highest point of the city,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "calling to those who pass by,",
          "who go straight ahead on their paths:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Whoever is inexperienced, enter here! ”",
          "To the one who lacks sense, she says,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Stolen water is sweet,",
          "and bread eaten secretly is tasty! ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But he doesn’t know that the departed spirits are there,",
          "that her guests are in the depths of Sheol."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
